  "notes": "Bug Z3 closure: Added 3 exports to src/core/memory-import.ts — backupRelations(store), restoreRelations(store, backup), rebuildWithRelationSafety(store, importFn, options). Implementation: (1) backupRelations uses store.getRawDb() to SELECT * FROM relations → EntryRelation[]. (2) restoreRelations performs FK validation (both from_id + to_id must exist in entries) before INSERT OR IGNORE, returns {restored, skipped}. (3) rebuildWithRelationSafety snapshots relations before transaction, wraps importFn + restoreRelations inside a better-sqlite3 transaction — in strict mode throws DeckentError('DECKENT_MEMORY_RELATION_LOSS', 'pre=X post=Y') which auto-rolls-back the transaction (including importFn's writes). All 7 tests in tests/core/memory-rebuild-safety.test.ts PASS. 4 pre-existing test failures (Stub Backfill H2, ADR FS Export H1, error-handling lint, alert-emitter) are from other sprint tasks (169-003/004/008 staged changes) — not caused by this task. tsc --noEmit: 0 errors.",
